  "descriptions": {
    "en": "**Planned** Wheel of Heaven Translation of selections from the Oomoto Shin'yu (大本神諭, Divine Revelations of Oomoto) from the Japanese. Initial scope: the first fude of Meiji 25 (1892) — the founding oracle of the 三千世界 (three-thousand worlds) plum-blossom opening and the world's rebuilding and renewal (立替へ立直し), with Ushitora no Konjin as the banished and returning kami."
